{"ticker":"XEL","updated":"2026-10-30T23:23:52Z","profile":{"longName":"Xcel Energy Inc.","shortName":"Xcel Energy Inc.","sector":"Utilities","industry":"Utilities - Regulated Electric","country":"United States","website":"https://my.xcelenergy.com","fullTimeEmployees":11534,"marketCap":49858310144,"trailingPE":21.868492,"forwardPE":17.58545,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":3.35227,"pegRatio":1.99,"targetMeanPrice":88.57895,"targetHighPrice":99.0,"targetLowPrice":74.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":19,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":0.066,"earningsGrowth":0.727,"grossMargins":0.47724,"operatingMargins":0.28570998,"profitMargins":0.17944999,"totalRevenue":14872999936,"beta":null,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":84.23,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":68.72,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":3.0},"summary":"Xcel Energy Inc., through its subsidiaries, operates as an electric and natural gas delivery company in the United States. It operates through Regulated Electric Utility and Regulated Natural Gas Utility segments. The company generates, purchases, transmits, distributes, and sells electricity through its energy portfolio, including wind, nuclear, hydroelectric, biomass, and solar power from both owned generation facilities and PPAs, as well as its fossil fuel energy portfolio, such as coal and natural gas; sale and resale of wholesale transmission service; and engages in wholesale commodity and trading operations. It also purchases, transports, stores, distributes, and sells natural gas; develops and leases natural gas pipelines and storage facilities; operates interstate natural gas pipeline; and invests in rental housing projects, energy technology companies, and community solar garden nonregulated assets. It serves electric and natural gas customers in portions of Colorado, Michigan, Minnesota, New Mexico, North Dakota, South Dakota, Texas, and Wisconsin. The company was formerly known as Northern States Power company. Xcel Energy Inc. was incorporated in 1909 and is headquartered in Minneapolis, Minnesota.","summary_zh":"Xcel Energy Inc. 透過其子公司在美國營運電力和天然氣輸送公司。它透過受監管的電力公用事業部門和受監管的天然氣公用事業部門運作。該公司透過其能源組合（包括來自自有發電設施和購電協議的風電、核電、水力發電、生質能和太陽能）以及煤炭和天然氣等化石燃料能源組合來生產、購買、傳輸、分配和銷售電力；批發傳輸服務的銷售和轉售；並從事商品批發和貿易業務。它還採購、運輸、儲存、分銷和銷售天然氣；開發和租賃天然氣管道和儲存設施；運營州際天然氣管道；並投資租賃住房項目、能源技術公司和社區太陽能花園非監管資產。它為科羅拉多州、密西根州、明尼蘇達州、新墨西哥州、北達科他州、南達科他州、德克薩斯州和威斯康辛州部分地區的電力和天然氣客戶提供服務。該公司前身為北方國家電力公司。 Xcel Energy Inc. 成立於 1909 年，總部位於明尼蘇達州明尼阿波利斯。","sector_zh":"公用事業","industry_zh":"公用事業 - 受監管的電力","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":72.04,"h":72.36,"l":71.53,"c":72.14,"v":3101400},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":72.06,"h":72.48,"l":71.54,"c":72.43,"v":3044900},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":72.81,"h":73.21,"l":71.52,"c":72.24,"v":6804800},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":72.67,"h":72.89,"l":71.99,"c":72.68,"v":6225900},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":72.94,"h":73.02,"l":71.33,"c":71.75,"v":6050900},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":71.46,"h":72.2,"l":71.29,"c":72.02,"v":5443400},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":72.05,"h":72.63,"l":71.74,"c":72.31,"v":5766800},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":72.28,"h":73.06,"l":71.92,"c":72.85,"v":7890900},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":72.85,"h":73.72,"l":72.6,"c":73.35,"v":7080600},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":72.96,"h":73.2,"l":72.53,"c":73.05,"v":2756600},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":72.8,"h":73.05,"l":72.05,"c":72.11,"v":3173500},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":72.29,"h":72.9,"l":71.95,"c":72.05,"v":5337600},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":71.63,"h":72.64,"l":71.35,"c":72.17,"v":3050000},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":72.32,"h":72.8,"l":71.88,"c":72.11,"v":10034000},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":72.62,"h":72.7,"l":71.8,"c":72.35,"v":4129800},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":72.03,"h":73.04,"l":71.84,"c":73.04,"v":4020000},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":73.18,"h":78.13,"l":72.55,"c":77.93,"v":14058700},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":78.16,"h":78.8,"l":76.94,"c":77.25,"v":10846000},{"t":"2025-09-26","o":77.56,"h":79.41,"l":76.97,"c":79.28,"v":7525500},{"t":"2025-09-29","o":79.46,"h":80.07,"l":78.41,"c":80.05,"v":5527100},{"t":"2025-09-30","o":79.77,"h":80.96,"l":79.59,"c":80.65,"v":4011